                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a week ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "We visited Times Square during the day, it's an incredible experience. Even under the bright daylight, the massive digital screens are mesmerizing, filling the area with vivid colors and dynamic advertisements that grab your attention from every angle.\n\nThe energy here is palpable, with crowds of people moving through the square, creating a lively and exciting atmosphere.\n\nThe red steps are a perfect spot to take it all in. From there, you can watch the world go by, surrounded by the iconic sights and sounds of this bustling hub. It's a great place to sit for a moment, snap some photos, and feel the pulse of New York City.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
