                    "rating": 2,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Not sure what the hype is all about. Definitely not my type. The flashy billboards at night are eye-catching, but that’s pretty much about it. Insanely crowded at all times, making it difficult to walk. You might wanna visit once during your NYC trip for the “experience”.",
