                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Bryant Park in New York City is an exceptional place to spend quality time and find peace of mind. As someone who visits this park frequently, I can attest to its unique charm and vibrant atmosphere. Nestled amid stunning skyscrapers, it offers a tranquil escape from the city's hustle and bustle. The park is always buzzing with cultural events, adding a dynamic and enriching layer to every visit. The presence of birds enhances the serene environment, making it a delightful experience for nature lovers. It's the perfect blend of urban and natural beauty and truly the best park I've encountered in New York City.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Bryant Park in New York City is an exceptional place to spend quality time and find peace of mind. As someone who visits this park frequently, I can attest to its unique charm and vibrant atmosphere. Nestled amid stunning skyscrapers, it offers a tranquil escape from the city's hustle and bustle. The park is always buzzing with cultural events, adding a dynamic and enriching layer to every visit. The presence of birds enhances the serene environment, making it a delightful experience for nature lovers. It's the perfect blend of urban and natural beauty and truly the best park I've encountered in New York City.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
