                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJd7I1IO5ZwokRbv7YUlgChl4/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNicExUYUZBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 weeks ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Loved visiting the Summit in March 2024. The views were stunning! We went an hour before sunset and stayed a couple of hours exploring all the levels. Loved being able to sit on a glass floor so high up! Lots of photo opportunities even though it was busy. I will definitely visit again on a future visit!",
