                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "This is really grat! You see a little movie about history in the recreated historic underground station Town Hall. Than you get a lot about informative and entertaining information in the museum, see filmset and artefacts and and at least you take a great virtual 4D Ride above New York, which you wish to be much longer, because it's simply great! Don't fear this ride, it's suitable for everyone. Even Grandpa! No rollercoster or like. Just a beautiful scenic flight.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
