                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "A no-brainer place to visit in New York City. Probably the most iconic place. There are so many bright and eye catching billboard ads covering the entire place. When you visit, you realize that there are so much people here in the world and that you are just a single human. It makes you feel very small and all of a sudden, you’re not the main character anymore. There are so much people of different kinds, backgrounds, identities, and walks of life here. The energy that this place gives off is so lively that words can’t describe it.",
