                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJhZJ3Yq5ZwokRop0t2AA2eWk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR0N0t6WTF3RRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I have to walk through the MetLife building every time I commute into the city for work. The entrance I go in leads right into Grand Central so it is very convenient. Every time I am walking back to commute home I get to see the MetLife sign on the building. I think it is pretty cool. Inside they have some stores like coffee shops and convenient stores though I never personally went in any. I would definitely recommend checking out the building if you are in NYC. Giving it five out of five stars.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
