                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 weeks ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I have to first commend the awesome staff! They were friendly and affable. The escape rooms itself is very interactive and immersive. Thank you for making our field trip a blast! The submarine one was 9/10 (some technical issues with the screen).",
