                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJwwwGE_tZwokRmpfoXySK-x0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEd19lNEp3EAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "We Escaped!!!\nThanks to Adan- she made it the very best experience for my 9yr old. Adan was our guardian / eyes-in-the -sky on the heist and offered very supportive coaching! Samuel at the front desk was also  very welcoming and kind  …great team = great experience! We loved it so much - we took Adans invitation to come back and try their favorite room, buying our return trip before leaving! Great experience! Great People! I would definitely offer this to my staff for a Team building reward/ experience as well!\nNotably: Challenging room( I watch heist movies and some how thought I was qualified - was I surprised- 7 minutes from Prison is what I was !!!) just go - they have an excitable team at Madison Ave!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
