                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJwwwGE_tZwokRmpfoXySK-x0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqOElxV0JREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "We attended a team-building event at an escape room where we took on the jailhouse breakout challenge, and it was a blast. The fun began as our team divided into two groups, Cell One and Cell Two. We had to collaborate through the walls to escape our cells and eventually, as one large group, break out of the jailhouse completely. With just four minutes to spare, we managed to escape. It was an incredible team-building exercise, and we're eager to return to this location to try out different escape room themes.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "We attended a team-building event at an escape room where we took on the jailhouse breakout challenge, and it was a blast. The fun began as our team divided into two groups, Cell One and Cell Two. We had to collaborate through the walls to escape our cells and eventually, as one large group, break out of the jailhouse completely. With just four minutes to spare, we managed to escape. It was an incredible team-building exercise, and we're eager to return to this location to try out different escape room themes.",
