                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJg_WHdcxZwokRAE8YxvMgp4A/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMxeVBTc0hBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Wonderful experience. Very easy process of getting tickets in advance online. Check in, bag, and shoe storage was convenient. Plenty of staff on hand on and off the ice to make sure things were running safely and smoothly and to help people as needed. Enjoyed skating. Many people brought their own skates and many rental skates available as well. A variety of different sized “pushers” were available for those who needed help staying upright. So many types of vendors in the village to shop from for food, drink, amenities, and gifts. This a recommended stop when in Manhattan.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Wonderful experience. Very easy process of getting tickets in advance online. Check in, bag, and shoe storage was convenient. Plenty of staff on hand on and off the ice to make sure things were running safely and smoothly and to help people as needed. Enjoyed skating. Many people brought their own skates and many rental skates available as well. A variety of different sized “pushers” were available for those who needed help staying upright. So many types of vendors in the village to shop from for food, drink, amenities, and gifts. This a recommended stop when in Manhattan.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Dr. Sheridan Mish",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105769068346453435822/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWA81tpYEwMhL77bKVVPGDSfJ-d56ozIcv9PxA5M_-JqtlKTVH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2023-12-21T13:26:40Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJg_WHdcxZwokRAE8YxvMgp4A/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWci1EcFBBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Bryant Park has been transformed into a Winter Village. With a beautiful tree, an ice rink & stalls of every description. Ranging from food and drink to Christmas decorations to doggy items including coasters, socks,  candles, jewellery. You can also hire the igloos for a cost.  We had a hot chocolate, made with actual melted chocolate and marshmallows, best ever... It does get very busy, but definitely worth a visit.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Bryant Park has been transformed into a Winter Village. With a beautiful tree, an ice rink & stalls of every description. Ranging from food and drink to Christmas decorations to doggy items including coasters, socks,  candles, jewellery. You can also hire the igloos for a cost.  We had a hot chocolate, made with actual melted chocolate and marshmallows, best ever... It does get very busy, but definitely worth a visit.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Susan Oldham",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106670482077010113633/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITJehDXIAjrYcfjtGQZDgfMZwduAwgB48pGby2J2pV32dD1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2023-12-18T23:16:15Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJg_WHdcxZwokRAE8YxvMgp4A/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURWeXVHOFpnEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I enjoyed a date here but it got really packed and the freshly prepared rink turned way too choppy within the hour. They should definitely limit the amount of skaters per hour.\n\nI did appreciate being able to bring my own skates and only pay $5 for a small locker.\n\nThe food options and quality is too typical of American fast food, which was quite a letdown. The Würstel didn't look appetizing and was served in a hotdog bun. 😥\n\nI guess it's nice to walk around to take in the views, the colors and the art.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "I enjoyed a date here but it got really packed and the freshly prepared rink turned way too choppy within the hour. They should definitely limit the amount of skaters per hour.\n\nI did appreciate being able to bring my own skates and only pay $5 for a small locker.\n\nThe food options and quality is too typical of American fast food, which was quite a letdown. The Würstel didn't look appetizing and was served in a hotdog bun. 😥\n\nI guess it's nice to walk around to take in the views, the colors and the art.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Asher Bronstein",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105686042671866764807/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUWfZtrSPnMX50Ztx4EH3Kwzjc1HKKztfFFELkNHJiNeuU6s0EOw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
