                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJPfEQoU5awokRNdBwGAHP83E/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUak5TaHdBRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Great little spot to stock up on last-minute unique New York gifts. I wouldn’t really call this a museum or a gallery so much as just a gift shop. The collection there is great and the staff working are extremely helpful. 10/10 re commend for any kid gifts you might need.",
