                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Take a break from the city and recharge here..so calming and beautiful. Regardless of your faith, non-faith in life this place is yoga for your spirit. One lap around the inside and you will feel peace in your heart ❤️.",
