                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Cool lace dedicated to the amazing NYFD, their history and some of how they operate today. The firefighters present were helpful to answer questions and seemed genuinely happy to take photos with kids and adults as well as explain their jobs. Super awesome to see something dedicated to the brave men and women, first responder, fire fighters of any city and especially NYC.",
