            "primaryType": "vegan_restaurant",
            "shortFormattedAddress": "712 7th St NW, Washington",
            "editorialSummary": {
                "text": "Vegan takes on burgers, chicken wraps, and shakes offered in a compact counter-serve setting.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "reviews": [
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJkRSt_JG3t4kRlvCXTZ0C3ho/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUckltdDRRRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "HipCityVeg is a must-try for anyone seeking delicious and satisfying fast food. This spot is open until 2 am, offering creative takes on classic favorites. Everything on their menu, from burgers and sandwiches to fries and decadent desserts, is 100% vegan, but you won't miss the meat! Their Philly cheesesteak is a standout, with a flavorful filling that delivers a satisfying bite. Don't miss their crispy sweet potato fries for the perfect sweet and salty combo. Whether you're vegan or simply looking for a delicious and unique fast-food experience, HipCityVeg has something to satisfy your cravings.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "HipCityVeg is a must-try for anyone seeking delicious and satisfying fast food. This spot is open until 2 am, offering creative takes on classic favorites. Everything on their menu, from burgers and sandwiches to fries and decadent desserts, is 100% vegan, but you won't miss the meat! Their Philly cheesesteak is a standout, with a flavorful filling that delivers a satisfying bite. Don't miss their crispy sweet potato fries for the perfect sweet and salty combo. Whether you're vegan or simply looking for a delicious and unique fast-food experience, HipCityVeg has something to satisfy your cravings.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Vineeth Sudhir",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118047174368825683041/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeIA2NA2_6eNfpnO8CQU82MisP2hspA9k8KVt1l-dDreN0LZezeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-05-11T22:46:36Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJkRSt_JG3t4kRlvCXTZ0C3ho/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMMDduUE5REAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 3,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Stopped in for lunch and had the Supreme sandwich. It was pretty average compared to some of the other plant-based restaurants I've had in DC. The fries and kale lemonade were delicious, though! Would eat again, though and maybe try something different.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Stopped in for lunch and had the Supreme sandwich. It was pretty average compared to some of the other plant-based restaurants I've had in DC. The fries and kale lemonade were delicious, though! Would eat again, though and maybe try something different.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Laura Thomaswick",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106823598478195074584/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQbd9haJkz4BXFTuFs1i-M_JvwYhI0RNT6ErNnxpWKgX_qmBH_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-22T22:43:57Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJkRSt_JG3t4kRlvCXTZ0C3ho/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURENXFqUVNnEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Very tasty vegan burgers, the Ziggy burger and the Oh, Maitake burger, thank you for the gluten-free option! I also liked the turmeric tangerine lemonade and green smoothie. Great spot, nice staff, thank you!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Very tasty vegan burgers, the Ziggy burger and the Oh, Maitake burger, thank you for the gluten-free option! I also liked the turmeric tangerine lemonade and green smoothie. Great spot, nice staff, thank you!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Eva Komarkova",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103234101016214153129/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJelpyHzSxDN1LZ5ETBHRyxlVRoyGWpzfvDp5KNjEoOOdGSqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-04-08T21:25:17Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJkRSt_JG3t4kRlvCXTZ0C3ho/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUaDllU3pBRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 3,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "The protein portions are tiny in the salad and the snack wraps are also tiny therefore making the bang for the buck very low. The sauces are delicious though! The salad wasn’t bad it just needed more protein and some seeds or avocado (healthy fats) to make it more wholesome.\n\nJust these two things totaled $19 and there’s no indication that this stuff is organic. Plus, there are no reusables even for those dining in which gives a junky vibe.\n\nFor the price there are better options in the area unless you need a quick vegan kinda junk fix. And the music playlist has way too many pop-teenager breakup songs.\n\nI also had to wait a bit before anyone noticed I was ready to order.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
