                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Gabriella B. Teixeira",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104326771130498904369/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYbqjhnt35crOihTC1ADo6TUka8jYWwJxhaiedt5Babmf1hjrX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-05-28T19:42:46Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJkRSt_JG3t4kRlvCXTZ0C3ho/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNWZ0xfUXdBRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I stumbled across this place, looking for something good to eat downtown DC. And let's just say I am happy I did. I got the mushroom burger combo, and it was really good and came out in a speedy fashion. When I came in there's wasn't too many ppl in the side, but they kept coming and going while I enjoyed my food. $19 for a health choice meal wasn't bad at all. I was full and satisfied with my choice and order. The kale lemonade was really good it pared well with my meal. The cashier was somewhat insightful on the different ingredients in the food, and that was a bit helpful. Overall, I enjoyed myself the food the location and the atmosphere. If I am in DC anytime soon, I know where to get a vegan meal ‼️",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
