                "description": {
                    "text": "Trendy fast-casual restaurant in Penn Quarter specializing in vegan comfort food for lunch and dinner.\nThe plant-based menu features burgers, milkshakes, and salads. Highlights include the crispy hipcity ranch, the Philly cheesesteak, and the sweet potato fries. There are also gluten-free and organic options, as well as a kids' menu.\nPopular for solo dining, the venue has a casual atmosphere with counter service. People praise the staff.\nCustomers typically spend $10–20.",
                    "languageCode": "en-US"
                },
