                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Delivered food from here this time. Although I did experience the dine in option a while ago and tried dosa tacos. This time ordered something different like the samosas, cauliflower Manchuria and Chili paneer. The delivery was really quick and took about 20 mins. We liked the samosas, they were good. The Manchuria, taste wise was spot on but I wish the cauliflower were crisper. Same with the paneer, taste was 10/10 however the texture of paneer of more like a 6/10. Over all, we enjoyed the food and will order again.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
