            "primaryType": "vegan_restaurant",
            "shortFormattedAddress": "655 K St NW, Washington",
            "editorialSummary": {
                "text": "Middle Eastern-inspired vegan sandwiches, dips, salads & snacks in a stylish, counter serve.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "reviews": [
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJS1Jubo23t4kRmOZK892NpYI/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3dHJ1S053EAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "in the last week",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I love Shouk! This is my go-to spot whenever I travel to DC. My goal is to try everything on their menu, but it is hard because everything I've had has been spectacular! Everything is fresh, vibrant, and flavorful. The fried mushrooms are nicely seasoned, and the fries are one of a kind. The sauce flavor profile is unique and has you craving more.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "I love Shouk! This is my go-to spot whenever I travel to DC. My goal is to try everything on their menu, but it is hard because everything I've had has been spectacular! Everything is fresh, vibrant, and flavorful. The fried mushrooms are nicely seasoned, and the fries are one of a kind. The sauce flavor profile is unique and has you craving more.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Denzel R",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109782397795312657095/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_NPdaVj30vroXjd8epiVnvl5HZKTFTxKKQaJw6VYCzSyRDfXS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-08-15T15:31:59Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJS1Jubo23t4kRmOZK892NpYI/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3dE55bTZnRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a week ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "What an absolute gem.\n\nFor in person dining you order at an iPad Kiosk which was very simple and easy. Made sorting through the menu+add ons a breeze. Everything was fresh, perfect spice levels, the works.\n\nIf you’re looking for a fast, casual, healthy meal you won’t do much better than this.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "What an absolute gem.\n\nFor in person dining you order at an iPad Kiosk which was very simple and easy. Made sorting through the menu+add ons a breeze. Everything was fresh, perfect spice levels, the works.\n\nIf you’re looking for a fast, casual, healthy meal you won’t do much better than this.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Matthew Bakke",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107585671134556909861/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7vu_k1fMAEEtWRmeLn1yT56c5nwi2kqw3KY-SBBfBehOvf79R=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-08-13T00:52:53Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJS1Jubo23t4kRmOZK892NpYI/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6eThfd3lRRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Hands down some of the best food I've ever eaten! I got the oyster mushroom schnitzel and fries, and my life is seriously changed. Everything was delicious. My only complaint is the price. I wish it was a little cheaper. But I will definitely be returning to try more!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
