                "description": {
                    "text": "Fast-casual Indian restaurant in the Navy Yard neighborhood offering healthy bowls with vegan, vegetarian, and halal options.\nThe menu features a variety of proteins, vegetables, and sauces that guests can add to a grain bowl or salad. Popular items include chicken tikka, naan, and mango lassi.\nThe space is cozy and inviting, with meaningful paintings at the entrance and cool music. The service is described as sweet and helpful.\nCustomers typically spend $10–20.",
