                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Such a fun time with great food. Wonderful with my multiple food allergies. Even our friends who are not vegan loved the food and experience. Great drinks both with and without alcohol. Great gluten free options. We will definitely go back. Staff was attentive and friendly. They even brought us free bang bang broccoli when our entrees were taking a little longer.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Such a fun time with great food. Wonderful with my multiple food allergies. Even our friends who are not vegan loved the food and experience. Great drinks both with and without alcohol. Great gluten free options. We will definitely go back. Staff was attentive and friendly. They even brought us free bang bang broccoli when our entrees were taking a little longer.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Meg Silfee",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103482904511150631877/reviews",
