                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-22T03:16:04Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJ7aCfw2C3t4kRvb6eK8AmDGQ/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3a3V2dTZ3RRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "in the last week",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Great atmosphere in a vegan establishment. Great service and management staff. The food menu is good with monthly exclusives. One downfall is that the menu shifts, which means something you love may be gone or \"out\". Been many times, and every time, there is something unavailable on the menu. Overall, highly recommend the brunch French toast,  crispy mushrooms (or the roll). Bubble waffle is also a fave dessert. Fifty shades of green drink was a fave, no longer on menu but cucumber mint lemonade is a great alternative. Overall great place to brunch, have dinner,  meet friends, and enjoy the vibes.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
