                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJ7aCfw2C3t4kRvb6eK8AmDGQ/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5eTVDTWNBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I really liked this place. Loved the vibe, the space is beautiful, the service is great, and having a total veg menu restaurant option is fantastic. The Singapore noodles were ok. The spinach dumpling was bland. The General D’s cauliflower was too sweet for my taste but my friend liked this dish a lot. The hot chili oil condiment seemed to have cumin or something like that mixed in and I strongly recommend they not do that anymore. Did not order the watermelon masquerading as “tuna” because I don’t see the point of mimicking meat dishes in this way. I’m an omnivore so maybe my veg friends will disagree! I’ll definitely come back!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "I really liked this place. Loved the vibe, the space is beautiful, the service is great, and having a total veg menu restaurant option is fantastic. The Singapore noodles were ok. The spinach dumpling was bland. The General D’s cauliflower was too sweet for my taste but my friend liked this dish a lot. The hot chili oil condiment seemed to have cumin or something like that mixed in and I strongly recommend they not do that anymore. Did not order the watermelon masquerading as “tuna” because I don’t see the point of mimicking meat dishes in this way. I’m an omnivore so maybe my veg friends will disagree! I’ll definitely come back!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
