            "primaryType": "vegan_restaurant",
            "shortFormattedAddress": "Corner Building, 3501 Georgia Ave NW C, Washington",
            "reviews": [
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJp3I0c7jJt4kRE42L4kQW5zY/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN6OGZLNFRnEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I had an AMAZING experience at Cane and Coconut! They have many options for vegans and vegetarians. There are options to meal prep and fresh fruit to purchase. I'd give them 20 more stars of I could. One thing I'd say about pricing is: you will pay for quality. What you don't pay to eat healthy, you will pay to the doctors for the illnesses you have. I HIGHLY RECOMMEND you visiting.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "I had an AMAZING experience at Cane and Coconut! They have many options for vegans and vegetarians. There are options to meal prep and fresh fruit to purchase. I'd give them 20 more stars of I could. One thing I'd say about pricing is: you will pay for quality. What you don't pay to eat healthy, you will pay to the doctors for the illnesses you have. I HIGHLY RECOMMEND you visiting.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Leslie B. Akinola",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114424192377677122239/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlyQZHDdXE6xtZbc3RIG1wpQbIUS7YqMtiv9zh6rgeCMZ29ad0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-02T23:04:39Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJp3I0c7jJt4kRE42L4kQW5zY/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURULTlDRlZBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Needed some good veggies to go with some fried fish and stopped in. The owner was very nice and provided a lot of information into options. Ordered the kale salad and it was pretty good although the dressing tasted to be made with nuts which was a little distinctive.\n\nLoved the fresh food options as well as the produce!\n\nDefinitely would try again and would also like to see what there beverages taste like!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Needed some good veggies to go with some fried fish and stopped in. The owner was very nice and provided a lot of information into options. Ordered the kale salad and it was pretty good although the dressing tasted to be made with nuts which was a little distinctive.\n\nLoved the fresh food options as well as the produce!\n\nDefinitely would try again and would also like to see what there beverages taste like!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
