                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-05-28T14:13:16Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJp3I0c7jJt4kRE42L4kQW5zY/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5MUtycWRREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Every time I go I always have a great time and know I am getting good quality, tasty food and drinks.\nThe owner Greg sincerely enjoys bringing fresh flavors and products to the community. He is welcoming to all and will answer any question you may have to help and make your experience a positive one.\nSolid spot for vegan, gluten free, and dairy free food. The flavors are new and exciting, definitely worth a try!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Every time I go I always have a great time and know I am getting good quality, tasty food and drinks.\nThe owner Greg sincerely enjoys bringing fresh flavors and products to the community. He is welcoming to all and will answer any question you may have to help and make your experience a positive one.\nSolid spot for vegan, gluten free, and dairy free food. The flavors are new and exciting, definitely worth a try!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
