                        "text": "Speechless! Top tier! Service was top 10! Food was TOP 10!!! Education was top 10! They are passionate people in there! They love what they do and it’s an honor to learn but mostly eat with them! Phenomenal! Like wow! Shoutout to Greg for his insight and wisdom! And the coconut & cane mix is 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥 I feel too blessed 🥲",
