                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Staying in a hotel and ordered broccoli cheese soup, gluten-free vegan waffles , a salad and drink…. All delicious! The broccoli cheese soup was the best I’ve ever had and it’s a treat to be able to have waffles. Everything tasted fresh and healthy- THANK YOU! I’m vegan and gluten free and appreciate this delicious option.",
