                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Oh my goodness, I happen to see this establishment in passing. I'm not vegan but I was curious and wanted something on the healthier side so I stopped by.\n\nThe ambience was welcoming and there were 2 kiosks where you can order your food.\n\nI ordered the general tso's with a base of half rice and half salad.\n\nThe food was AMAZING. Fresh, flavorful absolutely delicious!!! To me it tasted better than chicken!  I was so pleasantly surprised and wish we had one in my home state.\n\nI would highly recommend it!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
