                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Jenny and her team went above and beyond to make our event special. The service we received was A+! We were amazed at how many non-alcoholic beverage options were offered. The vegan hors d’oeuvres were delicious; and the mixologist Tia made each drink to perfection! If you’re having an event and want to impress your guests Ginger Beet is the caterer to call. You will not be disappointed!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
