                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Tried the food at a Valentine's Day even at Bingebar-Dc and gingerbeet D-livered!\n\nThis is a higher tier of vegan food. The taste was even better than the presentation.\n\nThe crab cake has some smoky garlic spinach and sweet potato ?stuffin? - exquisite combination!\n\nWhen I tasted the Jambalaya I had to ask her where she was from and then it all made sense\n\nWe loved the food so much @TerineeB/wife started talking to her about being a caterer for our vowel renewal.\n\nTips\n1)  Typically does catering but will \"pop up\" on ya\n2)  Follow the chef on IG @gingerbeetdc to see where she will pop up next\n3) The chef trains (weight) and does seminars on plan based nutrition\n4) Come ready to splurge; this the type of food that 5) everything was top tier",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Tried the food at a Valentine's Day even at Bingebar-Dc and gingerbeet D-livered!\n\nThis is a higher tier of vegan food. The taste was even better than the presentation.\n\nThe crab cake has some smoky garlic spinach and sweet potato ?stuffin? - exquisite combination!\n\nWhen I tasted the Jambalaya I had to ask her where she was from and then it all made sense\n\nWe loved the food so much @TerineeB/wife started talking to her about being a caterer for our vowel renewal.\n\nTips\n1)  Typically does catering but will \"pop up\" on ya\n2)  Follow the chef on IG @gingerbeetdc to see where she will pop up next\n3) The chef trains (weight) and does seminars on plan based nutrition\n4) Come ready to splurge; this the type of food that 5) everything was top tier",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
