                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Soooo good! Warm hearted, down to earth folks who make delicious vegan jambalaya. They also had creative non-alcoholic sangria infused with bitters and hibiscus (they were catering in front of Union Market). Bartender is great; Jenny hired really well. They deserve the (continued) success that is coming their way and I'll look out for the location that Jenny plans to open!",
