                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJaWByBoP8g4UROUpcphMgUbA/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaXzRlQWhBRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Exceptional Vegan Catering and Meal Prep Service!\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nI have been a loyal customer of this fantastic Black-owned vegan catering and meal prep company for quite some time now, and I can't recommend them highly enough! Whether it's for my wellness events in the city or my private meals, they consistently deliver outstanding service and delectable dishes.\n\nThe attention to detail and creativity in crafting vegan dishes that are both nutritious and delicious is truly remarkable. Every event I've hosted with their catering has been met with rave reviews from attendees. The food is always fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented.\n\nThe owner's passion for plant-based cuisine shines through in every meal. It's evident that she takes great pride in sourcing the finest ingredients and putting together menus that cater to various dietary needs. From savory main courses to delectable desserts, every bite is a testament to her culinary expertise.\n\nFurthermore, the professionalism and reliability of this company are unparalleled. They are always punctual, accommodating, and go above and beyond to ensure customer satisfaction. The level of personal attention I receive, both in planning events and private orders, makes me feel valued as a customer.\n\nIn addition to their exceptional catering services, their meal prep offerings have become an integral part of my personal wellness routine. The convenience of having nutritious, chef-prepared meals ready to go has been a game-changer for my busy lifestyle.\n\nIf you're in search of top-notch vegan catering or meal prep services, look no further. This company is a true gem in the heart of the city, and I'm grateful to have them as a partner in my journey towards a healthier, plant-powered lifestyle. Don't hesitate to give them a try - you won't be disappointed!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
