                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-08-18T02:09:54Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJTS2ac_q3t4kRYIlCRzGad1Y/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMMTVXdzhBRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Amazing food. Unique options and taste. Went twice so far. Many Small plates to share. They can accommodate allergies.\n\nWeek of June 22 2024 - Somehow the AC is broken for a week and the temps are in the 90s at 9pm. it was very uncomfortable. I would have preferred to postpone and actually enjoy dinner rather faning ourselves with the menu.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Amazing food. Unique options and taste. Went twice so far. Many Small plates to share. They can accommodate allergies.\n\nWeek of June 22 2024 - Somehow the AC is broken for a week and the temps are in the 90s at 9pm. it was very uncomfortable. I would have preferred to postpone and actually enjoy dinner rather faning ourselves with the menu.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Venkata “Ashok” Amirineni",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105250822070206121695/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3UCRqYyQD4AUpFtxleV9RhNj-0hM20FeZYL2KONY7JVJ9nxHiTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-23T21:29:50Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJTS2ac_q3t4kRYIlCRzGad1Y/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqZ1A3RVVnEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Best sushi I've ever had and completely plant based! We sat beside the kitchen with the glass view of the dishes being prepared, and it was clear that there was such clear intention and execution behind each dish that came into the dining room. This is what I imagine when I think about plant based dining!!! The service was amazing! Try their brunch menu and the al pastor taco bowl!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
