                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "My husband and I were really excited to try this place out and it did not disappoint! Very attentive service and attractive modern decor. All the food and drink we ordered were well plated and delicious. Favorites include the croquettes, queso fundido, and taco al pastor bowl.",
