                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJTS2ac_q3t4kRYIlCRzGad1Y/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ5aG92NFlREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Recently had an opportunity to visit the opening of the new Planta Cocina. Entirely vegan restaurant menu in a beautiful bright location. There is paid street parking nearby. The menu has Latin and Asian fusion menu items (show in pictures) with pricing $$. We were able to sample many of the menu items and my favorite on the new menu is Al Pastor Taco Bowl. The menu includes staples from their original menus including the bang bang broccoli and torched and pressed sushi (two of my personal favorites). The hosts and staff were courteous and attentive and provided great recommendations (like the cheesecake for dessert). If you are vegan, vegan curious or just want a good meal I definitely recommend.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
