            "shortFormattedAddress": "1190 New Hampshire Ave NW, Washington",
            "editorialSummary": {
                "text": "Polished restaurant & lounge serving contemporary Indian food, wine & cocktails.",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "reviews": [
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJMUs6-ra3t4kRueqJ32bEmDU/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3bElQVGtRRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a week ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Lovely place for a pre-theater evening or a lovely dinner out. The menu has a wide variety of options for all diet types. The presentation of the food is eye candy prior to your first bite. Highly\nRecommend you try this one! Lovely wine list as well.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Lovely place for a pre-theater evening or a lovely dinner out. The menu has a wide variety of options for all diet types. The presentation of the food is eye candy prior to your first bite. Highly\nRecommend you try this one! Lovely wine list as well.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Lisa Billingham",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114456336594595386075/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdlZWC8waDzltRHQsIlJ8vn5pUFLn-XjmyFKPXGxegIv3_SwB7UA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-08-12T21:00:58Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJMUs6-ra3t4kRueqJ32bEmDU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMMW9DX1FREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 3,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I will caveat my review by saying that as someone who has eaten a lot of authentic Indian food, I do tend to review Indian teas but harsher but I was a bit disappointed in my overall dining experience here. We had a good meal but I felt like for the prices I’d either expect larger portions, as is traditional with Indian restaurants, or some sort of special twist with the dishes. It was good food but I felt like the dishes were the same kind you could get anywhere just in a fancier establishment. But I still did enjoy the food and the restaurant itself has a fun and unique setup.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "I will caveat my review by saying that as someone who has eaten a lot of authentic Indian food, I do tend to review Indian teas but harsher but I was a bit disappointed in my overall dining experience here. We had a good meal but I felt like for the prices I’d either expect larger portions, as is traditional with Indian restaurants, or some sort of special twist with the dishes. It was good food but I felt like the dishes were the same kind you could get anywhere just in a fancier establishment. But I still did enjoy the food and the restaurant itself has a fun and unique setup.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Gurleen Kaur",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115510005265661826798/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUySzwYOXhIJ_5OM3NFi0iPPPuJdx_bEristgVUIhnAPEZbg913jA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-18T22:06:26Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJMUs6-ra3t4kRueqJ32bEmDU/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqazRibl9BRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Everything tasted amazing. I kept eating until it hurt and then I was cramming more food in my mouth because my tastebuds wanted to ignore my stomach’s pleas. I wish I had a bigger stomach to taste many more dishes because Rasika seems like a place that makes every single dish delicious with a variety of different flavors to keep you interested and wanting more. Service was great, they tended to our needs without being overbearing.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Everything tasted amazing. I kept eating until it hurt and then I was cramming more food in my mouth because my tastebuds wanted to ignore my stomach’s pleas. I wish I had a bigger stomach to taste many more dishes because Rasika seems like a place that makes every single dish delicious with a variety of different flavors to keep you interested and wanting more. Service was great, they tended to our needs without being overbearing.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Paw Yi",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117308503601138062559/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzXxYqiDMRt_FE_NLp2GTZlZDKhS86TyWNv9hrJJBxdfWmZQYl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-05-07T05:52:35Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJMUs6-ra3t4kRueqJ32bEmDU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMdnBfNFFREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Best Indian food I’ve had in years. Absolutely loved the fried spinach and fish appetizers. Shocked to admit it was the best fish dish I can remember. Chicken tikka masala was super tender and creamy and naan bread light and puffy. 10/10.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
                        "text": "Best Indian food I’ve had in years. Absolutely loved the fried spinach and fish appetizers. Shocked to admit it was the best fish dish I can remember. Chicken tikka masala was super tender and creamy and naan bread light and puffy. 10/10.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "authorAttribution": {
                        "displayName": "Dave Sedgwick",
                        "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103173656043567241951/reviews",
                        "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgckx2hHDJ-gqSD13EhfkAxHOEqywIpieQ_tM8ng9b1n_ACHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
                    },
                    "publishTime": "2024-06-19T16:49:51Z"
                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJMUs6-ra3t4kRueqJ32bEmDU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNyN3ZQdFNBEAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 4,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "An upscale Indian restaurant with very nice ambience. Dishes are unique and great overall. Crispy Spinach, Fish Chili Garlic, Duck Makhani  were delicious! Halibut curry was just ok in my opinion: fish and curry are good but just don’t really fit together. Between the 2 curry dishes we had, Makhani was much better. Beetroot goat cheese was ok, not my fav and i would order something else next time. There are many interesting dishes we want to try.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
