                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Cute shop, fresh and tasty/flavorful food, reasonable wait time, nice staff.\n\nEverything was good. My favorites were the steak and cheese egg rolls and the dumplings.\n\nPricing is $7-14/dish. We ordered enough to have dishes we only took a bite of and took home for lunch the next day.\n\nPaid parking on the block had plenty of spots  a weekday lunch time.\n\nSteady stream of customers, but not overcrowded.",
