                    "text": {
                        "text": "I got the angry noodles and their trolley fries. Overall I think it has good flavor, but the amount vegetables is a bit too much. I especially didn't enjoy the big pieces of whole green onion. If it was chopped into smaller pieces, I think it be a bit more tolerable. Tables are also very odd and not very good for sitting and eating if there's more than two people.\n\nI had some friends with me who weren't vegan and the thoughts were mixed. Overall, a good place for vegan food, but the weird layout for seating, and particular textures in the food make this hard to recommend over other spots.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
