                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "This place is incredible!! The vibe is insane and the food goes right along with it. This is one of the few places we’ve been to that offers a vegan charcuterie board, and while on the pricier side, it was worth every penny! Will continue coming back over and over!!",
