                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJHY3ob1W3t4kR2_MWpD7zbUM/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUczhpRXV3RRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "We were spending a day in DC and a place called “Vegan DC” felt just right ;) We saw a lot of options on the menu plus a cute wooden terrace which made it the perfect stop after a lot of walking on a hot sunny day. We went all out and ordered multiple dishes, food came fast, it was delicious and everything felt super fresh! Perfect food and spot at the right moment. Our favorite dish was the popular potato skin dish 🤤 Too bad we couldn’t try it all!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
