                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJHY3ob1W3t4kR2_MWpD7zbUM/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiaDdubVd3EAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 weeks ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "One of my favorite go to spots in DC for great vegan food and drinks from coffee to cocktails and mocktails any time of day. It’s hard finding a place that is COMPLETELY vegan + I’ve convinced my skeptical carnivorous friends to tag along. Dc vegan takes the cake, by giving a wide selection of plant based interpretations on classics and you don’t really notice the absence of meat. Gave a 4 for atmosphere solely based on the fact that it’s always freezing cold in here no matter what time of day or year I’ve been, would really love to see this place expand.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
