                    "text": {
                        "text": "Here's a review for DC Vegan in Washington DC:\nI enjoyed my experience at DC Vegan. The staff was friendly and welcoming, and the atmosphere was inviting. The extensive menu offered a variety of exciting vegan options, and the desserts were particularly delicious. They even sell vegan cheese, which was a great find! Overall, DC Vegan is a great spot for vegans and non-vegans alike.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
