                    "text": "Trendy, romantic restaurant and bar in Downtown, Northwest Washington providing a 6-course vegan tasting menu for dinner.\nThe fine-dining establishment also offers an a la carte menu at its downstairs bar, which is open for drinks until 10:30pm.\nPeople often order the kale chips, sorbet, and vegan caviar. There are also happy-hour specials. Reviews mention the wine pairing and the knowledgeable staff.\nCustomers typically spend $100+.",
