                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 months ago",
                    "rating": 3,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Vegetarian perspective\n\nThere were great options for vegetarian and vegan. However, I thought the menu sounded better than it tasted. I got the paneer bowl and I usually find Indian food like addicting. You have one bite and can't stop. This was not the case for this. It was corporate Indian food, like Panera for Indian food. The service was quick and friendly, the interior was colorful and has seating, but most orders were takeout.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
