                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJ19EBtIW5t4kRlMYSEamFscw/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaOEs2UmNREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
                    "rating": 1,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "The name of the location should not be equated to the food quality or taste.\nThe Puri’s had an oily stale smell\nThe Napkins had a stale smell\nThe waiters and cooks were arguing as if you were on the streets of India. That was the one thing true about the name of the place.",
