                    "text": {
                        "text": "This was the highlight of our trip! We enjoyed their plant based brunch, where everything was vegan!\n\nThe 8 course menu was extremely delicious! The red curry butternut soup was amazing as was the granola crusted French toast. The vegan cream and raspberry jam on it were so good!\n\nThe spiced rum caramel cakes were also incredible.\n\nWe look forward to seeing how the brunch menu changes in the spring!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
