                    "text": "Trendy fine dining restaurant in Downtown's Connecticut Ave/K Street area highlighting seasonal, regional fare with vegan and vegetarian options.\nMenu items include the equinox truffled mac and cheese, slow-cooked breast of muscovy duck, and pumpkin soup. The vegan brunch and desserts are popular. People also like the drinks.\nFeaturing a fireplace and a romantic atmosphere, this upscale restaurant is good for date nights. There's also a tasting menu, happy hour, and private dining. Outdoor seating is available. Reviews say the service is great.\nCustomers typically spend $50–100.",
