                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "This is by far my absolute favorite restaurant in all of DC! I ordered the lasagna, sweet potatoes, and Mac and cheese and everything was amazing. The staff was also very nice and gave huge portions too. I would absolutely recommend this place to any and everyone that wants a great meal.",
