                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I exaggerate not that living abroad the last few years I’ve frequently fantasized over the sweet kale here and I make it a priority to go here anytime I’m back in town. My staples are the bbq tofu, mac n cheese and red wine kale but it’s one of those places you can’t go wrong. I plan on returning for a smoothie and cinnamon bun the size of my face before leaving.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
