                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Best vegan food I’ve ever eaten in my life. So glad I stopped in while visiting DC. Our favorites were the lasagna, the Mac and cheese, the kale salad, the mushroom salad, and the cinnamon bun. But, all things we tried were very good! Definitely will be coming back for my annual DC trip next year.",
