                },
                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJoS6rHx3It4kRIlSnlkEbnaY/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3bWZqNm1BRRAB",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "in the last week",
                    "rating": 1,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "This was a horrible experience today. Worst one I've ever had at a restaurant. The food was great, but everything else was horrible. Where do I start? They only had 3 things available on the menu. After we placed our order, we were told they can only take cash and couldn't take credit cards. Had to have exact change, because they couldn't give change. Couldn't give me a receipt. Had no ketchup for our French fries. No air conditioning. It was like an oven in there when eating lunch. This was rated online as the best vegan place to eat in DC. I took my 80 year old Mother there, who's been vegan over 50 years. I've been vegan 25 years. And have eaten at many vegan restaurants across the country, over 48 states. If this is the best place in town, I'd hate to see the worst. Absolutely not recommended.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
                    "originalText": {
