                {
                    "name": "places/ChIJE3EX2pO3t4kRtfRlVwm6pYg/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoa1lxeVNREAE",
                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "In a week in DC, I ate here for every single meal. Finding vegan AND gluten free AND genuinely healthy meals can be a struggle. But not at Fruitive. All offerings were delicious (I believe I tried almost everything on the menu that was both vegan and gluten free), creative, and made me feel energized and amazing! The staff are wonderful; all were happy to accommodate my and my family’s individual preferences.  The ambiance is warm and cheerful; the bliss of sipping a yummy smoothie while people-watching after a long walk through DC on a wintry morning is a pleasure I’ll miss until I’m back in the area. Wonderful job, Fruitive!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
