                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "Great food, all vegan. They pay attention to any dietary restrictions and have attentive and friendly service. Great atmosphere and very clean. We had the corn waffle, spicey tuna roll, guacamole, chilaquiles, and al pastor bowl. Our favorites were the spicey tuna and al pastor bowl (would highly recommend both.) This is also a great place to take someone who is skeptical of vegan food, it will show them that it can also be delicious. 5 stars 🌟",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
