                            "text": {
                                "text": "I am not vegan, but am a foodie and love trying all types of food as long as they are delicious. Planta went above and beyond my expectations in every aspect. It is the type of food you dream about long after you have digested it. I have two upcoming trips and I have already included dining at Plants in my itinerary in both trips. I was pleasantly surprised to have the best sushi—vegan or not— have ever had in my life. I ordered the spicy tuna roll, bam bam broccoli, among other dishes. Their drinks are also refreshing, original, and delicious. My server was also accommodating and pleasant. Once he was aware I was gluten free, he went out of his way to label the menu with a dry erase marker so I can easily identify the foods that can be modified to be gluten free; I felt included and cared for. This is now one of my all-time favorite restaurants.",
