                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 months ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I have dined in at this restaurant three times so far. Each and every time that I eat at this restaurant, I have the most pleasant experience…even with dining out; the portion sizes are the same that you receive as you do when you’re dining in. That’s important to me because when I spend my hard earned money to receive food for nourishment, and I get the same amount of food when I dine out versus when I’m dining in that’s always a problem. You will not find this a D.C. Vegan the portion sizes are the same, the taste is the same, the flavor is the same and the customer service is the same for the time that you walk in the door to the time that you walk out. Also, by me being gluten-free whenever I leave the restaurant or whenever I have take out…after eating all of my food the heaviness of food sitting on my stomach is not as heavy as it would’ve been eating traditional foods from a regular restaurant getting a gluten-free or a vegetarian or vegan option at that restaurant. I have no idea what they do, but it’s some type of greatness that after you’ve eaten good healthy food and you feel good about what you’ve just eaten…that’s an easy 2 thumbs up for me!",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
