                    "text": {
                        "text": "Absolutely incredible restaurant. Photos of the food and environment do no justice to this place. The food is impeccable and every single dish you eat you simply can’t guess what it tastes like nor the consistency. It’s the best tasting food I’ve ever had in my life.\n\nI took my girlfriend here for her birthday, and I couldn’t have asked for a more beautiful time. The hostess, servers, and sommelier all said happy birthday and acknowledged the special day.\n\nWe had the fixed 6 course winter menu with the wine pairing. I highly recommend adding the wine tasting to the evening, as the sommelier creates a beautiful story and tasting experience. Just as a heads up, the experience was about 3 hours flat, and we enjoyed every second of it. You never wait too long for food or drink, and it allows you time to soak in the experience.\n\nAs an added bonus: I really appreciate the detail and time it takes to put these dishes together. I’ve been on the vegan journey for about a year and a half now, and it brings me great joy to now know such a restaurant exists in DC. Vegan or not, this will be some of the best tasting food you will ever try in your life.\n\nThank you to everyone who made the night so special!",
