                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I am a big foodie and I was so happy to have a nice vegetarian lunch here. I ordered Vada pau and I can tell by experience that the vada was fresh and hot. The spice level was perfect and the price was very reasonable for the quality and taste of the food. I also got Pau Bhaji which was made with generous amount of Amul Butter (best butter for Indian food). I also got a tava roti which was perfect with the bhaji.\n\nOur server Sameer was very welcoming and attentive. Had hard time to find parking around but if you plan it well, you should be fine. Parking is a little tricky anywhere in DC.\n\nAllover for 2 pieces of Vada Pau, 1 Pau Bhaji, 1 diet coke, 1 kulfi and 1 tava roti my bill was  $35.00 which is absolutely reasonable. The menu is not too big to be confused.\n\nKeep the great work up.",
                        "languageCode": "en"
                    },
