                    "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
                    "rating": 5,
                    "text": {
                        "text": "I first had the food from this company at Broccoli city festival last year and fell in love. (literally had their \"sausage\" glizzy 2x that day ). and then after a long year of waiting I had their carrot glizzy and their sausage glizzy again and they did not disappoint. The food is amazing, flavorful and fresh (something you don't get as often with vegan food). Plus their mission and involvement with the community is admirable.  I will definitely be recommending all of my friends here and will be stopping by again soon.",
